      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i get the rag gtpases part. but what about the metabolic cost? like if the surplus isn't high enough or if the leucine timing is off, how does that affect the efficiency of the nitrogen retention? i want to know why even with leucine, a deficit would totally kill the anabolic signal.",
